        "created_at": "2020-11-13T05:09:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The latest update on the Freedom Five Kickstarter revealed a new bit of lore: a member of Grand Warlord Voss's army who appears to have a lot to do with gene-binding research, Gene-Doctor Kronz: https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/arcanewonders/freedom-five-a-sentinels-comics-board-game/posts/3018904</p>\n<p>So, Thorathian version of Farscape's Scorpius? Ew! Let's all make sure to defeat him.</p>\n<p>(Though his name keeps making me think of Gene Kranz, the famous Apollo flight director, haha!)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:28.067Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
