        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>The latest update on the Freedom Five Kickstarter revealed a new bit of lore: a member of Grand Warlord Voss's army who appears to have a lot to do with gene-binding research, Gene-Doctor Kronz: https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/arcanewonders/freedom-five-a-sentinels-comics-board-game/posts/3018904</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So, Thorathian version of Farscape's Scorpius? Ew! Let's all make sure to defeat him.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(Though his name keeps making me think of Gene Kranz, the famous Apollo flight director, haha!)</p>",
